From ac754a2b155088532bbc1903311ddcb04131d16b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
Date: Sun, 04 Oct 2026 23:11:03 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] LatinIME: Add split keyboard geometry transformer

Add a transformer that moves the keys of a built keyboard into two
halves pushed against the edges, leaving an empty gap in the middle.
The space key spans the gap, and keys straddling the midline go to the
side holding most of them or, optionally, to both sides.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ifa6919abef71a3c484757e9544f399deefa64c7b
Signed-off-by: Jis G Jacob <studiokeys@blissroms.org>
---

